[{"title":"奉和王继学怀济南旧游四首 其四","author":"范梈","text":"手接新词绝底清，一双白眼为君青。\n寰区政待新年谷，江汉徒传赤日萍。\n断雨潜蛟虚水榭，远波回鹭实云汀。\n此情可在齐州外，不解无人问独醒。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":7904,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"和田师孟郎中寒夕西曹即事","author":"范梈","text":"正是西曹遣翰初，落花寒食柳微舒。\n每因作者留心苦，多恨时人守法疏。\n诗思偶关绵上史，刑修正在腹中书。\n平生万卷苏居士，皓首东坡雪不如。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":7905,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"上真应寺观寺后龙湫，湫在厓上，盖由寺北下马，并高数十折得之。又数步许，得巨石，有僧龛，其中云即唐卢叟所隐成道处。时日斜，方焚香诵经，闻客至，乃辍诵相迎作茶云","author":"范梈","text":"凭高窈窕辨精蓝，濯佩还思访古潭。\n字扁孟家题处碣，洞留卢叟去时龛。\n近人野鸟如曾识，问客山精不敢谈。\n闻说平坡犹在上，登临虽倦且停骖。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":7906,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"雨后坐郝大参亭子","author":"范梈","text":"每见人来问草堂，偶从燕坐忆沧浪。\n地形远竞朝霞爽，林气清分宿雨香。\n移石旋成行药径，障泉思引钓鱼航。\n他年紫绶归黄阁，几杖苔生尽不妨。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":7907,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"雨后过王长史","author":"范梈","text":"省郎近佐三公府，想得深怀似故山。\n风急游丝当院静，雨余芳草闭门闲。\n未离尘土长思蜕，已近江湖不论还。\n自尔相看慰岑寂，不闻朝署有新班。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":7908,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"挽刘提举","author":"范梈","text":"逝川无力可能攀，又送先生葬碧山。\n化鹤不归华表上，鸣鸡倘在白云间。\n空歌楚水巫阳些，不见蓬洲使福还。\n毕竟修文阴有待，玉楼何许泪潸潸？","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":7909,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"和谢伯雨见惠之作","author":"范梈","text":"骚灵逝矣不堪呼，几欲南游讯楚巫。\n城郭烟涛垂白帝，星河风露浥黄姑。\n幽人往恨九关豹，佳士今犹千里驹。\n久客资君相慰藉，可能无意谢飞凫。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":7910,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"送黄中庸归吟","author":"范梈","text":"法乐洞前曾一游，君家闻处洞西头。\n石潭正照猿猱月，山药曾经虎豹秋。\n岂意吴城祠下路？\n共寻扬子岸头舟。\n胸中富有天官学，莫为周南久滞留。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":7911,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"莲房","author":"范梈","text":"忆得花神一笑欢，六郎家住小江干。\n佳人怨等秋风近，稚子眠听浦雨寒。\n强为折来开户牖，谁将镕出拟杯盘。\n少年太守思兄弟，戢戢青头莫漫看。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":7912,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"桂子","author":"范梈","text":"尽输金粟三千斛，换得琼枝数点秋。\n定是月中嘉种失，却从世上异香浮。\n石岩夜见呼猿摘，药臼晴敲伴兔秋。\n十月天台谁得见？\n西风吹梦落山头。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":7913,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"送夏兰同知会昌","author":"范梈","text":"承闻吉日上江船，佐命分符落雁边。\n野馆溪头三晋雪，山城留下七闽烟。\n庭春花气迷铜墨，市瞑溪声学管弦。\n何日周庐寻夜直？\n倍知报政九重天。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":7914,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"赠广居查尊师远游","author":"范梈","text":"查君学道恋名山，庐结东南紫翠间。\n更忆皇州春色好，却辞仙馆曙光闲。\n千年城郭逐人去，八月星河奉使还。\n莫为昆仑无觅处，早将诗赋动江关。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":7915,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"至怀安县，又入福州","author":"范梈","text":"山城列障驻余霞，水与长空远映沙。\n芍药省中人望幸，荔枝林外客思家。\n遥遥徐韨三神棹，渺渺张骞八月槎。\n蚤岁学游今白发，不应犹恋枣如瓜。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":7916,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"平台晚怀","author":"范梈","text":"落日微风生晚凉，平台西上万山苍。\n佳人独不生同世，乐土那知是异方？\n海岳云霞千古意，乡关道路九回肠。\n丹青不写归田赋，犹以虚名累霍光。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":7917,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"送李秘书泂","author":"范梈","text":"秘书出自蓬莱苑，流落东吴又一春。\n见月定怀骑鹤侣，闻秋肯让鲙鲈人。\n吾曹事业徒温饱，子等居诸异隐沦。\n海表何由携手再，相怜同是老词臣。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":7918,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"送别周仪之推官赴钱塘并简李四秘书","author":"范梈","text":"武帝龙飞第一春，京华相送各沾巾。\n讵知邂逅文身地，总是栖迟皓首人。\n山驿蛟眠星满洞，水乡雁起月迷津。\n若逢李泂南天竺，为说前书感谢频。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":7919,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"开岁","author":"范梈","text":"自违北极向南辰，重见东皇似故人。\n合席管弦方殿岁，殊乡花柳觉先春。\n水归楚泽鱼俱化，土覆周郊兽亦仁。\n薄宦于时无补报，且须康济百年身。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":7920,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"草堂","author":"范梈","text":"草堂不在万山峰，时有幽人步往踪。\n雨压墙烟笼薜荔，石行渠水鉴芙蓉。\n清名岂让陶贞白，共住犹强陆士龙。\n忽忆雁行天外去，归来期在粤城中。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":7921,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"题张果老骑驴图","author":"范梈","text":"细柳官桥路，骑驴不用鞭。\n先生诚有道，此去亦千年。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":7922,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"题竹树图","author":"范梈","text":"老树半垂叶，疏篁斜露根。\n若无烟雾隔，应见石西村。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":7923,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"秋江","author":"范梈","text":"秋生洲渚静，露下蒲荷晚。\n忽忆钓鱼时，人家楚乡远。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":7924,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"建昌小湖望庐阜二首 其一","author":"范梈","text":"青云覆叠巘，白鸟度平湖。\n钓屿夜来雨，山深知有无？","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":7925,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"建昌小湖望庐阜二首 其二","author":"范梈","text":"我怀贞炼士，多在岩谷阴。\n惟有高林月，长知望远心。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":7926,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"题二仙图","author":"范梈","text":"明月万山空，溪桥暗路通。\n不知何洞府？\n终夕坐松风。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":7927,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"绝句六首 其一","author":"范梈","text":"障拥芙蓉竞，灯随榉柳移。\n繁星临迥野，疏雨过高池。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":7928,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"绝句六首 其二","author":"范梈","text":"江上打鱼船，有头那无尾。\n与卿相见时，不望如鱼水。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":7929,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"绝句六首 其三","author":"范梈","text":"乡路西州是，延平那向东。\n片帆侬会使，祇是怕随风。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":7930,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"绝句六首 其四","author":"范梈","text":"水清滩自急，荡桨直须人。\n劝卿休恨水，多为不知津。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":7931,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"绝句六首 其五","author":"范梈","text":"水如青铜镜，山色绿芙蓉。\n中天明月上，此处好相逢。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":7932,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"绝句六首 其六","author":"范梈","text":"日净芙蓉远，春明芍药长。\n谁怜玉蝴蝶？\n正似锦鸳鸯。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":7933,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"看东亭新笋","author":"范梈","text":"问竹何年有，亲曾共岁寒。\n昨传新笋发，扶杖绕林看。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":7934,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"送别","author":"范梈","text":"为君垂别泪，更向杨花侧。\n斗酒问离鸿：几时归故国？","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":7935,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"烛夜","author":"范梈","text":"烛影夜侵墙，松桂成行列。\n鼓绝草虫鸣，四山露华结。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":7936,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"秋江图","author":"范梈","text":"云里衡阳雁，网下武昌鱼。\n石门秋共远，江树雨余疏。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":7937,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"芙蓉","author":"范梈","text":"芙蓉生石壁，云锦映青松。\n那忆南州路？\n归船处处逢。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":7938,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"东署","author":"范梈","text":"习静天常见，居深路近通。\n阴阶垂叶露，空院长春风。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":7939,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"怀小柏","author":"范梈","text":"手种庭前小柏树，分枝散叶总天成。\n涉旬不见长相忆，况是经年别友生。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":7940,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"枫林雨止","author":"范梈","text":"篱角枫林露鹊巢，春深翠叶未全交。\n山家老屋浑相似，千里行人识把茅。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":7941,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"题黎氏家山图","author":"范梈","text":"漠漠家山在白云，石桥流水路斜分。\n状元坊里重来日，还有新阡表陆君。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":7942,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"社日","author":"范梈","text":"丘邻雨止散青烟，白叟相违已隔年。\n忽遣大儿三角结，打门来觅社神钱。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":7943,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"赠卓秀才还澧州","author":"范梈","text":"不说从师学道难，一身千里暮云端。\n是行若拜庭闱罢，有使题诗祇寄兰。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":7944,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"五月二十六夜宿松林兰若","author":"范梈","text":"白沙寨下接飞霞，行至招提日已斜。\n睡觉忽闻山寨语，不知今夕离吾家。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":7945,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"瑞州城东水边松下，遇老翁稚子，萧然有桃源想","author":"范梈","text":"花墙竹栅护长松，云去柴门昼启封。\n不是武陵州县古，秦人那得晋人逢？","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":7946,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"登高风亭（亭在三刘祠后，今西涧书院刘凝之书，高安人子道原、孙义仲）","author":"范梈","text":"罢官本自亦由君，直节高风世世闻。\n天下布衣能致禄，多应无传附青云。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":7947,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"桑落洲","author":"范梈","text":"桑落洲前秋兴孤，白云远见近还无。\n传闻酒吏经年罢，美酿家家得纵沽。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":7948,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"发湖口","author":"范梈","text":"已过匡庐却向西，片帆犹逐暮云迷。\n路长正是思亲节，取次惊猿莫浪啼。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":7949,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"浔阳","author":"范梈","text":"露下天高滩月明，行人西指武昌城。\n扁舟未到心先到，卧听浔阳谯鼓声。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":7950,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"题山水图","author":"范梈","text":"烟崖窅窅树栾栾，三两渔舟戏碧澜。\n不解买山头已白，今朝又得画图看。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":7951,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"十月白牡丹，郢中孙氏家植也","author":"范梈","text":"霜槛枝头结素云，分明便有绣成裀。\n紫皇为爱春风早，特向瑶台折赠君。","collection":"元","notice":"","pr